            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Robin Lynd"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I liked these as directed, but maybe I was looking for more of a daiquiri. The second time I made them, I replaced the tequila with coconut rum and it was exactly what I wanted. I forgot the triple sec both times and didn’t miss it.",
