              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DIZ9829"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Comparatively speaking, these are pretty good. I was expecting a sweet margarita, but mine tasted bitter and tart. Perhaps the secret is to use over ripe bananas.",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-11T15:52:36.400Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
